scn 1
# Overtaking (2026-11-15; tools/legion_overtake_test.py): a single-file column of 12 bodies walking north, slow
# 2x2 bodies (speed 1.15, an Aramon Archer's) and fast 3x3 ones (2.9, an Aramon Knight's) mixed, each on an order
# of its own to its own point 144 cells ahead (4 cells apart), as the computer player sends its army. Asset-free.
# Open field, attack-move orders: a fast body held behind a slow one steps aside and passes it.
name overtake-field
ticks 5000
players 1
weapons off
map flat 128 200
type slow mover 2 2500 1 1.15
type fast mover 3 2500 1 2.9
group S0 0 slow 1 cells 60,150
group F1 0 fast 1 cells 60,152
group F2 0 fast 1 cells 60,155
group S3 0 slow 1 cells 60,158
group F4 0 fast 1 cells 60,160
group S5 0 slow 1 cells 60,163
group S6 0 slow 1 cells 60,165
group F7 0 fast 1 cells 60,167
group S8 0 slow 1 cells 60,170
group F9 0 fast 1 cells 60,172
group S10 0 slow 1 cells 60,175
group F11 0 fast 1 cells 60,177
at 5 fight S0 38 6
at 5 fight F1 42 6
at 5 fight F2 46 6
at 5 fight S3 50 6
at 5 fight F4 54 6
at 5 fight S5 58 6
at 5 fight S6 62 6
at 5 fight F7 66 6
at 5 fight S8 70 6
at 5 fight F9 74 6
at 5 fight S10 78 6
at 5 fight F11 82 6
